usage: module-nav lifecycle [-h] [--pattern LC_PATTERN] [--module LC_MODULE] [-n N] [class_name]

positional arguments:
  class_name            Class name (e.g. BAlarmService)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --pattern, -p LC_PATTERN
                        Show classes implementing a specific lifecycle (e.g. started)
  --module, -m LC_MODULE
                        Filter by module
  -n N                  Limit results (default 50)
